Package: pointcore
Title: Point-Cloud Form for Mesh Spec: Returns as Rows with Ids
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Michael", "Sumner", email = "mdsumner@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Prototype (working name). Reads LAS, LAZ and COPC files into the
    point-cloud form proposed for mesh spec v0.1: a points table with every
    LAS attribute and a row per return, a sources table recording where each
    return came from, and the form's CRS. A TIN built from the points keeps
    each vertex's point row, and a face_points link table joins every return
    to the triangle it falls in, so a face picked in a render leads back to
    its returns.
